      "html": "<div class=\"ds-modal\"><div class=\"ds-modal-header\"><h2>清理令牌</h2><button class=\"ds-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button></div><p class=\"ds-modal-desc\">清理后引擎会立刻停止轮询，直到重新粘贴令牌。</p><div class=\"ds-modal-footer\"><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-outline\">取消</button><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\">清理</button></div></div>",
